  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Transformation and Modernization Program of the Energy Sector II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transformacin Institucional y Modernizacion delSector Energtico II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos especficos de esta segunda operacin son: (i) dar apoyo a la capacidad institucional del Gobierno de Hait para definir una poltica energtica y llevar a cabo la planificacin y supervisin del sector, y (ii) convertir a Electricit dHati (EDH), el principal proveedor de servicios pblicos, en una empresa viable desde el punto de vista financiero y operativo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objectives of this second operation are to: (i) support the GoHs institutional capacity to define an energy policy and perform the planning and oversight of the energy sector; and (ii) turn the main utility, Electricit d Hati (EDH) into a viable financial and operational company.</narrative>
  </description>
